1
00:00:00,325 --> 00:00:01,865
(Penny:)That's great.

2
00:00:01,927 --> 00:00:03,127
(clears throat)

3
00:00:03,195 --> 00:00:04,565
(Sheldon:)Wait a minute.

4
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:06,560
(Sheldon:)I know this may
sound farfetched,

5
00:00:06,632 --> 00:00:08,302
(Sheldon:)but I'm on the market now.

6
00:00:08,367 --> 00:00:10,097
(Sheldon:)You know, if I dated Mandy,

7
00:00:10,169 --> 00:00:13,069
(Sheldon:)that would teach both
Leonard and Amy a lesson.

8
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:14,638
(Penny:)That's ridiculous.

9
00:00:14,706 --> 00:00:16,836
(Sheldon:)Oh, you're right.
I could never be with a woman

10
00:00:16,908 --> 00:00:19,648
(Sheldon:)whose self-esteem was so low
she'd be with Leonard.

11
00:00:19,711 --> 00:00:22,381
(Penny:)I'm with Leonard.

12
00:00:22,447 --> 00:00:24,847
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I know. Forever.

13
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:26,886
(sighs)

14
00:00:26,951 --> 00:00:29,891
(Sheldon:)Who would have believed
these things would happen to us?

15
00:00:29,954 --> 00:00:31,424
Right? (scoffs)

16
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:34,430
(Penny:)I can't believe Amy
actually went through with it.

17
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,760
(Leonard:)Hang on.

18
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:39,398
(Sheldon:)You knew that she was
going to end it with me?

19
00:00:39,463 --> 00:00:41,163
(Sheldon:)Did you try
and stop her?

20
00:00:41,232 --> 00:00:45,402
(Penny:)I told her to be true to herself
and do what makes her happy.

21
00:00:45,469 --> 00:00:46,639
(Sheldon:)Do what makes her happy?

22
00:00:46,704 --> 00:00:49,204
(Sheldon:)She plays the harp and
her car is paid for.

23
00:00:49,273 --> 00:00:51,343
(Sheldon:)How much happier can she be?

24
00:00:52,176 --> 00:00:53,946
(Penny:)Okay, look, it's not my fault

25
00:00:54,011 --> 00:00:56,611
(Penny:)that she thought
you were a bad boyfriend.

26
00:00:57,682 --> 00:00:59,512
(Sheldon:)I see.

